  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "babf31978a12dacf",
      "translationZh": "Gemini API Managed Agents：3.6 Flash、钩子及更多功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8558d81caad1a2ec",
      "translationZh": "Gemini API 中的 Managed Agents 现在默认使用 Gemini 3.6 Flash。新的环境钩子让你可以在沙箱内阻止工具调用、对其进行静态检查或审计。此外，我们还新增了预算控制、定时触发器和免费层访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34bf795db0815904",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 技术团队成员",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52ce2e9a444c7ed5",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "本内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d6386607861abdd",
      "translationZh": "Gemini API 中的 Managed Agents 即将获得环境钩子、模型选择和免费层访问权限。这些能力是在我们上一次发布所引入的后台任务和远程 MCP 服务器集成的基础上构建的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e96d21d1bca18f7",
      "translationZh": "借助 Gemini Interactions API 中的托管智能体，单次 API 调用即可在隔离的云端沙箱内协调推理、代码执行、软件包安装、文件管理和网页检索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f80baab37d17ea3",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在使用 AI 编程助手，可以在终端中输入以下命令，让它能够访问 Interactions API 技能：npx skills add google-gemini/gemini-skills --skill gemini-interactions-api。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6002e09700d7c43d",
      "translationZh": "下面是使用 @google/genai TypeScript/JavaScript SDK 的示例。如需 Python 或 cURL 示例，请查看 Antigravity 智能体文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b02d9d393a572df",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.6 Flash 现已成为默认模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69d6ab82fdc03b5c",
      "translationZh": "antigravity-preview-05-2026 智能体现已默认运行 Gemini 3.6 Flash。无需更改代码。你的下一次交互将自动使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0851a911f9e0060",
      "translationZh": "你也可以在创建交互或托管智能体时，通过传入 agent_config.model 来显式选择模型。使用 Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite 可以降低成本，也可以固定使用你偏好的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5b717267b611d09",
      "translationZh": "支持的模型包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3cb29d8f3d73e4b0",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.6 Flash（gemini-3.6-flash，默认）：在推理、编程和工具使用方面表现均衡的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "435ab9cbe485709f",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.5 Flash（gemini-3.5-flash）：用于通用智能体工作流的上一代模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "636fb8558ff87955",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite（gemini-3.5-flash-lite）：Gemini 3.5 系列中延迟最低、成本最低的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "43c690a2169b2503",
      "translationZh": "环境钩子：拦截、检查和审计沙箱内的工具调用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae764dc4a4fb7521",
      "translationZh": "环境钩子允许你在智能体于其沙箱内进行的每次工具调用之前或之后，运行自定义脚本。在环境中添加一个 . agents/hooks.json，运行时就会在 pre_tool_execution 或 post_tool_execution 事件发生时执行你的处理程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d4295d953fdec78",
      "translationZh": "matcher 字段支持正则表达式，允许你使用 | 匹配多个工具，或使用 * 匹配所有工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "158d4907ac755b23",
      "translationZh": "security-gate 组会在每次 code_execution 或 write_file 调用之前运行 gate.py。如果脚本返回 \"decision\": \"deny\", \"reason\": \"...\"，则会跳过该工具调用，并将拒绝原因传入模型的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60c73f6aa8f72896",
      "translationZh": "auto-format 组会在每个工具执行完毕后运行 auto_lint.py，以强制遵循代码风格规范。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f2346c7d0b1efcb",
      "translationZh": "钩子还支持 http 类型的处理程序，可直接向外部端点发送 POST 请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2751ffb955338ac7",
      "translationZh": "有关完整的 HTTP 钩子定义和失败处理语义，请参阅钩子文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abbb575189a3738f",
      "translationZh": "各团队已经开始使用钩子来构建生产级验证流水线。例如，AI 原生投资银行 Offdeal 使用 post_tool_execution 钩子，在远程沙箱内运行自动化图像验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "164446dd6ccd66bc",
      "translationZh": "“OffDeal 是一家 AI 原生投资银行，Archie 是我们的银行家每天都在使用的 AI 分析师。要让演示文稿达到可供银行家使用的标准，公司标志是必不可少的：买方表格、财务投资方栏目、交易案例展示网格中都需要标志，一份演示文稿中往往有 30+ 个标志，每一个都必须对应正确的公司，具有适当的尺寸和宽高比，包含公司名称，拥有透明背景，并且放在白色幻灯片上时具有高对比度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf837fbf7ac3aa57",
      "translationZh": "在有智能体钩子之前，我们无法在 Gemini 的托管智能体上做到这一点：沙箱位于远程，因此我们的验证代码无处运行。有了钩子，Archie 一写出公司列表，post_tool_execution 钩子就会在沙箱内触发我们的流水线，获取候选图像，执行像素级质量检查，使用 Gemini 视觉能力验证每个标志，并发布一份已批准文件的清单，只有这些图像才允许被放入演示文稿。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a68902c0a79e561b",
      "translationZh": "Alston Lin，OffDeal 创始人兼首席技术官",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8490130a78636481",
      "translationZh": "成本控制和自动化功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cccc3e0264cbf23b",
      "translationZh": "免费层级可用性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08f6d8d54a3965a4",
      "translationZh": "托管智能体现已可用于免费层级项目。开发者可以使用未启用计费的项目中的 API 密钥，试验智能体工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "875a4ce940627a55",
      "translationZh": "由于托管智能体会执行多轮自主循环，复杂任务可能消耗大量 token 预算。为防止任务失控，你可以在 agent_config 中传入 max_total_tokens，以限制总消耗量（输入 + 输出 + 思考）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "123a816e052d7e83",
      "translationZh": "当智能体达到限制时，执行会安全暂停，交互返回 status: \"incomplete\"。环境状态会被保留，你可以通过传入 previous_interaction_id 并提供新的预算，从停止的位置继续执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "df988747be950da0",
      "translationZh": "通过触发器定时执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d29acc2f3c3f4a75",
      "translationZh": "使用定时触发器自动执行周期性的智能体任务。触发器将智能体、环境、提示词和 cron 调度绑定为一个持久化资源，无需人工干预即可触发。每次运行都会复用同一个沙箱，因此文件会在多次执行之间保留。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7df888c104889c6b",
      "translationZh": "Environments API 允许你通过代码列出、检查和删除沙箱会话。你可以在断开连接后找回环境 ID，也可以在流水线完成时清理沙箱，而不必等待 7 天的 TTL 到期。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2878f658871ea94c",
      "translationZh": "开始使用托管智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a84932289ae7684",
      "translationZh": "这些更新将托管智能体变成成本可控、定时运行的工作单元，它们能够在真实的开发环境中自主运行，既不会超出你的预算，也不需要外部编排。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22828d4a946053d7",
      "translationZh": "查看 Gemini Interactions API 概述和托管智能体快速入门，探索自定义智能体定义、环境配置、网络规则和高级流式处理模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 新闻",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f32c94e810121bc",
      "translationZh": "观看 Future Vision XPRIZE 获奖作品 The Gifted 的预告片。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "717d7c74d523f088",
      "translationZh": "Google Beam 拓展至新地区，迎来新合作伙伴和客户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3070dbe5b762a2c7",
      "translationZh": "新专家加入 Google 的 AI & Economy 团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
